  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Purple Mountain True Monarch’s recollection, Yellow laughs that they destroyed the Gu formation Limitless Demon Venerable created, then names Limitless true inheritance as the best thing to be happy about: they got past the final test, and the true inheritance is theirs. Purple agrees that this way their hope of executing their major plan has increased, and that they will continue to gain more true inheritances and resources.",
      "chapters": [
        1371
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "char_yellow",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan and Lang Ya land spirit exchange inheritances, Lang Ya land spirit obtains Spectral Soul’s true inheritance, Limitless’ true inheritance, Red Lotus’ true inheritance, Paradise Earth’s true inheritance, and countless other true inheritances. Fang Yuan is giving away inheritances Shadow Sect had collected; in return he obtains almost all the inheritances of Lang Ya Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        1447
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "inh_spectral_soul_true_inheritance",
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As far as the Three Crazed Demon Eccentrics are concerned, they do not care about righteous path or demonic path: from their perspective there is only Limitless’ true inheritance, and they will acknowledge anyone who can help them achieve that desire.",
      "chapters": [
        1450
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-eccentrics",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_three_crazed_demon_eccentrics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable created the rank nine immortal killer move karma divine tree after gaining inspiration from Limitless Demon Venerable’s true inheritance, using fate as soil and luck as water to find the root cause and effect of matters.",
      "chapters": [
        1516
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-inspiration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Fang Yuan’s third trip into Crazed Demon Cave, his main target for the trip is Limitless’ true inheritance. He plans to gather venerable true inheritances so that triggering venerable methods can support destroying fate Gu, and he treats Crazed Demon Cave as the most reliable clue.",
      "chapters": [
        1863
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-trip",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Demon Immortal Qi Jue lists Limitless’ true inheritance among the venerable true inheritances Fang Yuan possesses, together with those of Red Lotus, Thieving Heaven, Giant Sun, Spectral Soul, Reckless Savage, Primordial Origin, Genesis Lotus, and Paradise Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        2054
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
